# Frontend

- Parse dates with `safeParseDate()` from `safeStorage.js`. Never `new Date("YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm")` (Safari).
- All storage via `safeStorage`, always in try/catch. Do not read `localStorage` at module top level.
- `browserDetection.js`: try/catch; no `window`/`navigator`/`Notification.permission` at import time.
- Guest booking lives in `GuestBookingView.jsx` / `Booking.jsx`; keep host timezone vs guest timezone explicit.
- Build from `frontend/src` (Vite). Do not hand-edit `frontend/dist`. Keep `ChallengeDetail.jsx` importable from `App.jsx`.
```javascript
// ❌ BAD
new Date(`${date} ${time}`);
const token = localStorage.getItem("token");

// ✅ GOOD
safeParseDate(`${date}T${time}:00`);
try { token = safeStorage.getItem("token"); } catch (e) { token = null; }
```
